# Wren Simulacra
entry: opening

CHARACTER Wren is Keeper
  stats: Combat
  hp: 80
  trusts Player: 30 of 100
  reacts trust > 60 -> warm

  knows:
    met_player: bool = false
    saw_the_keeper: bool = false

  goal find_keeper
    priority: 0.8
    active when: true
    completes when: Wren.knows.saw_the_keeper

  on trust passes 80
    -> reveal_secret

== opening
  cast: Wren, Player
  setting: Lighthouse

WREN
  You came.

* Earn trust.
  -> earn
* Leave.
  -> END

== earn
  cast: Wren, Player

<set: Wren.trusts.Player += 60>

WREN
  Now you understand.

-> END
